  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Support the General Education Quality Improvement in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the successful completion of phase I to improve learning conditions and education institutional capacity by providing teaching and learning materials, teacher training and school grants designed to improve the quality of teaching and learning in schools. DFID support will help enhance learning outcomes for over  21.6 million children (of which 10.54 million will be girls). This contributes towards MDG 2 by ensuring every child attends primary school and increasing the number of children who stay in school by 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
